187688_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tusb9sPXNxYQ7kNvwEchEwz&_nc_oc=Adn0yacVDT2gaSalFZFpr-rZwWTfwzG1m5GRq5UDXNq4xaaKt2Ln7sgavGyC1hmtom8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfsBAfYXf_S_TzLQaSajC9vJ2MJMAtbMzFIQHcLpCRwJ0A&oe=699B0E08"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "LandScape.png", "id": "4526900444203911", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491830904_4526900447537244_1593155788570280980_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=PTkQcbjXBQwQ7kNvwH-4nBC&_nc_oc=AdnVSpp48eye5oBjZ1pplERr_ZCZ2huvi9DOm63ok_B_I53J-1UNeS6ecNInHk87UMg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu1cBl9nEL1nNsE3Zc6mQOSQ3IDj42Ej5Sf21w2Ta7MhA&oe=699B04E6"}, "display_name": "The Historical Art Gallery", "keywords": ["AI", "Gallery", "Art", "Paintings", "History"], "long_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings.", "short_description": "The Historical Art Gallery is a collection of famous historical paintings like:\n- The Scream, by Edvard Munch\n- La Promenade, by Pierre-Auguste Renoir\n- The Music Lesson, by Johannes Vermeer\n- Starry Night Over the Rh\u00f4ne, by Vincent van Gogh\n- Four Seasons in One Head, at and by Giuseppe Arcimboldo\n- In the Loge, by Mary Cassatt\n... and more\n\nHere you have a nice gallery environment setup with the statue of a horse in the middle, as an extra you can see how the AI animate the paintings."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://midicreationsvr.blo